                        </ul>
                        <br><br>
                        Covering every step of the process: <strong><i>[userflow, prototyping, reviews, Testing of form process]</i></strong>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section> -->

    <section class="section section--alt">
        <div class="content-split">
            <div class="copy-block">
                <div class="copy">
                    <div class="content-subtitle accent">02 [//] Goal</div>
                    <h2>Centralize to Scale</h2>
                    <p>The primary objective was to bridge the gap between <strong><i>service information and user-centric design.</i></strong> We focused on three strategic pillars: <br><br>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Simplification</strong>: Consolidating multiple courier services into a single, unified dashboard.</li>
                            <li><strong>Clarity</strong>: Prioritizing what you obtain and gain on this service.</li>
                             <li><strong>Conversion</strong>: Optimizing the user journey to turn initial interest into successful contact form submissions.</li>
                        </ul>
                        <br><br>
                        Covering every step of the process: <strong><i>[userflow, prototyping, reviews, Testing of form process]</i></strong>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="image-column">
                <img class="image" src="/images/process-eqapla-2.avif" alt="Image of the web design process - 1">
                <img class="image" src="/images/process-eqapla-1.avif" alt="Image of the web design process - 2">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="content-split">
            <div class="copy-block">
                <div class="copy">
                    <div class="content-subtitle accent">03 [//] onboarding</div>
                    <h2>A Frictionless Welcome</h2>
                    <p>We implemented a progressive onboarding flow to prevent user burnout. Instead of overwhelming users with long forms, we focused strictly on essential data points to streamline the initial experience. Ensuring a perfect fit for any device<br><br>
                        <ul>
                            <li><strong>Micro-interactions</strong>: Instant visual feedback to validate data entry and reduce errors.</li>
                            <li><strong>Validation & Automation</strong>: Leveraged <strong>Make</strong> and <strong>reCAPTCHA</strong> to prevent bot activity and automate form submissions, ensuring seamless communication with prospective clients.</li>
                        </ul>             
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="image-column">
                <img class="image" src="/images/e-qapla-mockup.avif" alt="Image of the web design implementation on webflow">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section full-bleed" style="background-image: url('../images/Collage_eqapla.avif');">
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <div class="container center">
            <div class="block">
                <span class="content-subtitle accent center">[//] Next Project [//]</span>
                <a class="next-project" href="../work/Inmape">Inmape
                    <svg 
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M3 12h17.5"/><path d="M21 12l-7 7M21 12l-7 -7"/></g></svg>
                </a>
            </div>
            <a class="button small fit" href="../work">
                <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="m4 10l-.354.354L3.293 10l.353-.354zm16.5 8a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0zM8.646 15.354l-5-5l.708-.708l5 5zm-5-5.708l5-5l.708.708l-5 5zM4 9.5h10v1H4zM20.5 16v2h-1v-2zM14 9.5a6.5 6.5 0 0 1 6.5 6.5h-1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-5.5-5.5z"/></svg>     
                Back to All Work
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>